; The Reality form of the rock: a stone.
;
; "Una piedra gris del tama�o de un pu�o, con el liquen seco en la parte
; de arriba y la base hundida en la tierra."
;
; So: a grey stone, faceted rather than smooth, dry lichen on the top,
; and its base sunk in the earth. The seam is the weight - it is heavier
; than a stone of that size should be - and the shape must not give the
; game away before you pick it up.

